      "role": "user",
      "content": "potassium citrate sounds interesting. i've heard people say it's great for neutralizing the acid in the kidneys. if i were to try a supplement for that, what would be a good daily amount to aim for to really make an impact? also, is it okay if i take it along with a high-dose vitamin c supplement just to cover both bases?",
